; The whole-circle corpus arc becomes the same Circle in step 1.
; Its set of points, returned Circle and depth are unchanged.

; A whole input arc is represented by CIRCLE in Tecnigrafo (ADR 0012).
C = CIRCLE center=0,0 radius=10
? hatch-boundary 0,0 units=6 -> enclosed loop=external+derived+edges circle=0,0;10
? hatch-boundary 10,0 units=6 -> on-curve C
? hatch-contours C -> loop=external+edges circle=0,0;10
